that... is that them?"}, {"t": 1156.98, "speaker": null, "line": "Is that the..."}, {"t": 1157.94, "speaker": null, "line": "Yeah."}, {"t": 1159.85, "speaker": null, "line": "Jesus. Jesus!"}, {"t": 1162.07, "speaker": null, "line": "Jesus fuck, please, please!"}, {"t": 1164.77, "speaker": null, "line": "Please, God, I just wanna go home."}, {"t": 1166.43, "speaker": null, "line": "I just wanna go home, please!"}, {"t": 1168.6, "speaker": null, "line": "God!"}, {"t": 1168.6, "speaker": null, "line": "Hey, man, you gotta shut up."}, {"t": 1170.87, "speaker": null, "line": "I just wanna go home! Please!"}, {"t": 1173.0, "speaker": null, "line": "Hey, look at me."}, {"t": 1175.74, "speaker": null, "line": "We're good."}, {"t": 1181.48, "speaker": null, "line": "What's wrong? What the... what's wrong?"}, {"t": 1183.31, "speaker": null, "line": "Fucking bleeding!"}, {"t": 1186.45, "speaker": null, "line": "What the fuck?"}, {"t": 1187.4, "speaker": null, "line": "You gotta be quiet."}, {"t": 1189.54, "speaker": null, "line": "I can't! I'm fucking bleeding from my fuckin' mouth!"}, {"t": 1191.93, "speaker": null, "line": "You're gonna be okay."}, {"t": 1193.5, "speaker": null, "line": "We just gotta hang on."}, {"t": 1195.5, "speaker": null, "line": "God, I just wanna fucking get outta here!"}, {"t": 1206.68, "speaker": null, "line": "My God, this is really happening."}, {"t": 1212.04, "speaker": null, "line": "Fuck this. Let us out."}, {"t": 1213.82, "speaker": null, "line": "Hey, whoa, whoa, whoa,"}, {"t": 1213.82, "speaker": null, "line": "Let us out."}, {"t": 1215.39, "speaker": null, "line": "Relax."}, {"t": 1215.39, "speaker": null, "line": "Let us the fuck out."}, {"t": 1216.61, "speaker": null, "line": "Hey! Hey, are you insane? Are you insane?"}, {"t": 1219.65, "speaker": null, "line": "Did you hear that?"}, {"t": 1219.65, "speaker": null, "line": "There's more people out there."}, {"t": 1221.61, "speaker": null, "line": "You've got those people trapped under the 