, "line": "'cause you sure as shit ain't opening those doors."}, {"t": 1355.57, "speaker": null, "line": "Almost there."}, {"t": 1366.76, "speaker": null, "line": "You ever wonder if Abby was right?"}, {"t": 1369.06, "speaker": null, "line": "Wh..."}, {"t": 1373.11, "speaker": null, "line": "Hey, what did you say?"}, {"t": 1375.85, "speaker": null, "line": "What if it's all just a dream?"}, {"t": 1378.12, "speaker": null, "line": "How the fuck do you..."}, {"t": 1382.68, "speaker": null, "line": "Martin! Wha-wha-what's... What's goin'..."}, {"t": 1385.3, "speaker": null, "line": "What's... What's goin' on, Martin?"}, {"t": 1386.99, "speaker": null, "line": "What? Okay, okay, okay, okay."}, {"t": 1389.21, "speaker": null, "line": "Martin. Okay, come here. Come here..."}, {"t": 1391.0, "speaker": null, "line": "All right. All right."}, {"t": 1393.83, "speaker": null, "line": "Okay. Hey, Martin, come on."}, {"t": 1407.23, "speaker": null, "line": "We're out of time!"}, {"t": 1410.28, "speaker": null, "line": "Come here, Martin..."}, {"t": 1412.24, "speaker": null, "line": "Let go, Martin!"}, {"t": 1413.28, "speaker": null, "line": "My blood is your blood now."}, {"t": 1421.24, "speaker": null, "line": "Martin?"}, {"t": 1425.25, "speaker": null, "line": "The fuck?"}, {"t": 1475.39, "speaker": null, "line": "Okay... okay..."}, {"t": 1486.09, "speaker": null, "line": "What the..."}, {"t": 1491.01, "speaker": null, "line": "Hey, hey. Hey."}, {"t": 1502.15, "speaker": null, "line": "What..."}, {"t": 1533.71, "speaker": null, "line": "I'm, um..."}, {"t": 1535.71, "speaker": null, "line": "I'm making some tea."}, {"t": 1546.98, "speaker": null, "line": "Uh, hi."}, {"t": 1549.11, "speaker": null, "line": "Oh, hi."}, {"t": 1551.9, "speaker": null, "line": "Uh, what are you doin'?"}, {"t": 1554.2, "speaker": null, "line": "My mom always says that food cures all ills,"}, {"t": 1557.16, "speaker": null, "line": "so, I don't know."}, {"t": 1559.69, "speaker": null, "line": "Tea."},