s like."}, {"t": 1658.05, "speaker": null, "line": "Well, maybe it's a prank or something!"}, {"t": 1659.44, "speaker": null, "line": "I don't know, Brian."}, {"t": 1659.44, "speaker": null, "line": "Okay."}, {"t": 1661.22, "speaker": null, "line": "Look, I'm sorry, I shouldn't have snapped."}, {"t": 1665.58, "speaker": null, "line": "Hey, it's an adventure, right?"}, {"t": 1669.32, "speaker": null, "line": "Right? Look, maybe... Maybe this is just gonna be"}, {"t": 1671.49, "speaker": null, "line": "like one of those, I don't know,"}, {"t": 1674.24, "speaker": null, "line": "crazy stories that we just tell at parties,"}, {"t": 1676.24, "speaker": null, "line": "and it'll be fun and it'll..."}, {"t": 1679.85, "speaker": null, "line": "Hello?"}, {"t": 1681.9, "speaker": null, "line": "Is anyone in there?"}, {"t": 1683.25, "speaker": null, "line": "Please, help us. We were on a bus."}, {"t": 1686.47, "speaker": null, "line": "We took a detour through town, but we stopped and..."}, {"t": 1689.25, "speaker": null, "line": "Hello?"}, {"t": 1689.25, "speaker": null, "line": "What the hell?"}, {"t": 1693.04, "speaker": null, "line": "Don't go. Don't go, baby."}, {"t": 1693.04, "speaker": null, "line": "I don't wanna die here."}, {"t": 1694.43, "speaker": null, "line": "We need help, please."}, {"t": 1694.43, "speaker": null, "line": "We've gotta help them out!"}, {"t": 1696.78, "speaker": null, "line": "Wait..."}, {"t": 1698.31, "speaker": null, "line": "I'll be fine."}, {"t": 1700.52, "speaker": null, "line": "Please help us."}, {"t": 1703.14, "speaker": null, "line": "Please."}, {"t": 1805.02, "speaker": null, "line": "Oh, thank God, we heard the screaming."}, {"t": 1807.11, "speaker": null, "line": "You picked a bad spot."}, {"t": 1822.6, "speaker": null, "line": "Gus! God dammit, slow down!"}, {"t": 1828.39, "speaker": null, "line": "Oh God. Fuck."}, {"t": 1834.01, "speaker": null, "line": "Okay. Okay. Oh, shit. This..."}, {"t": 1890.71, "speaker": null, "line": "The boy. The..."}, {"t": 1892.33, "speaker": null, "line": "The one who told you to wait in the tunnels."}, {"t": 1895.11, "speaker": null, "line": "He's my friend."}, {"t": 1898.07, "speaker": null, "line": "For a long time he went away,"}, {"t": 1900.16, "speaker": null, "line": "but now he's back."}, {"t": 1910.69, "speaker": null, "line": "How long have you been here?"}, {"t": 1912.65, "speaker": null, "line": "Oh, it's been a while."}, {"t": 1919.57, "speaker": null, "line": "How did you get here?"}, {"t": 1921.74, "speaker": null, "line": "I don't like to talk about that."}, {"t": 1928.49, "speaker": null, "line": "Oh, wow!"}, {"t": 1931.41, "speaker": null, "line": "I found them."}, {"t": 1934.8, "speaker": null, "line": "Look."}, {"t": 1937.33, "speaker": null, "line": "Yeah."}, {"t": 1941.03, "speaker": null, "line": "Chocolate chip."}, {"t": 1950.6, "speaker": null, "line": "If you don't want them, you don't have to have..."}, {"t": 1952.12, "speaker": null, "line": "No, no, I... I like chocolate."}, {"t": 1960.78, "speaker": null, "line": "Thank you."}, {"t": 1966.18, "speaker": null, "line": "I used to have more snacks..."}, {"t": 1968.97, "speaker": null, "line": "but there haven't been many new people"}, {"t": 1971.53, "speaker": null, "line": "come through here in the last few months."}, {"t": 1977.11, "speaker": null, "line": "Is that where you get all this stuff?"}, {"t": 1980.76, "speaker": null, "line": "Some of it."}, {"t": 1982.24, "speaker": null, "line": "I mean, some of it was here already."}, {"t": 1985.33, "speaker": null, "line": "Some of it belonged to my..."}, {"t": 1992.08, "speaker": null, "line": "To who?"}, {"t": 1997.87, "speaker": null, "line": "Who did you come here with?"}, {"t": 2002.57, "speaker": null, "line": "My mother."}, {"t": 2004.87, "speaker": null, "line": "She was nice."}, {"t": 2012.31, "speaker": null, "line": "Mm, I think... I think I have some pretzels,"}, {"t": 2015.32, "speaker": null, "line": "'cause these are stale."}, {"t": 2033.47, "speaker": null, "line": "What the..."}, {"t": 2033.47, "speaker": null, "line": "Boyd?"}, {"t": 2036.69, "speaker": null, "line": "What are you doing out here?"}, {"t": 2036.69, "speaker": null, "line": "Get in! Hurry!"}, {"t": 2038.82, "speaker": null, "line": "They'll see you!"}, {"t": 2038.82, "speaker": null, "line": "Okay. It's okay."}, {"t": 2041.47, "speaker": null, "line": "Don't worry."}, {"t": 2042.43, "speaker": null, "line": "Look."}, {"t": 2043.43, "speaker": null, "line": "Oh, my God!"}, {"t": 2043.43, "speaker": null, "line": "We're okay."}, {"t": 2045.3, "speaker": null, "line": "We're okay."}, {"t": 2045.3, "speaker": null, "line": "Help!"}, {"t": 2049.13, "speaker": null, "line": "Help me!"}, {"t": 2050.26, "speaker": null, "line": "Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa! Stop!"}, {"t": 2051.83, "speaker": null, "line": "Please!"}, {"t": 2053.7, "speaker": null, "line": "I said stop! Stop!"}, {"t": 2057.27, "speaker": null, "line": "Hey!"}, {"t": 2057.27, "speaker": null, "line": "They're killing people!"}, {"t": 2060.67, "speaker": null, "line": "We need to close the door!"}, {"t": 2060.67, "speaker": null, "line": "They're coming, they're coming!"}, {"t": 2061.89, "speaker": null, "line": "You need to run!"}, {"t": 2061.89, "speaker": null, "line": "Please!"}, {"t": 2063.28, "speaker": null, "line": "Fuck! Come on!"}, {"t": 2063.28, "speaker": null, "line": "Please!"}, {"t": 2064.58, "speaker": null, "line": "You need to get inside."}, {"t": 2064.58, "speaker": null, "line": "Get in here! Come on."}, {"t": 2066.72, "speaker": null, "line": "Come on, come on!"}, {"t": 2066.72, "speaker": null, "line": "Run, run, run!"}, {"t": 2068.85, "speaker": null, "line": "Come on!"}, {"t": 2068.85, "speaker": null, "line": "You need to get inside."}, {"t": 2069.81, "speaker": null, "line": "Come, on, run, run, run!"}, {"t": 2071.33, "speaker": null, "line": "Let's go! Hurry up! Hurry up!"}, {"t": 2071.33, "speaker": null, "line": "Run, run, run!"},