s skinny little fucker eats pancakes?"}, {"t": 2149.32, "speaker": null, "line": "Ow, fuck, that hurts."}, {"t": 2150.63, "speaker": null, "line": "You know, pancakes sound pretty..."}, {"t": 2156.59, "speaker": null, "line": "Ah, shit."}, {"t": 2158.46, "speaker": null, "line": "Shit."}, {"t": 2159.9, "speaker": null, "line": "Brick, Brick, you gotta shut the fuck up, man."}, {"t": 2163.42, "speaker": null, "line": "I know it hurts but keep quiet."}, {"t": 2165.64, "speaker": null, "line": "Breathe it out."}, {"t": 2167.95, "speaker": null, "line": "Nice and easy."}, {"t": 2170.99, "speaker": null, "line": "Tom."}, {"t": 2172.43, "speaker": null, "line": "You gotta cover his mouth, man."}, {"t": 2177.78, "speaker": null, "line": "I can't get to him!"}, {"t": 2202.76, "speaker": null, "line": "Tom, what's happening?"}, {"t": 2205.94, "speaker": null, "line": "Talk to me, man. What is it?"}, {"t": 2209.38, "speaker": null, "line": "I think he's fucking dead."}, {"t": 2220.65, "speaker": null, "line": "No, no, no! No! Get off! Jim!"}, {"t": 2226.7, "speaker": null, "line": "Get off me!"}, {"t": 2236.06, "speaker": null, "line": "Julie, Julie, no! Julie, no!"}, {"t": 2237.58, "speaker": null, "line": "No, we have to go out there!"}, {"t": 2238.63, "speaker": null, "line": "No!"}, {"t": 2238.63, "speaker": null, "line": "Please! We have to help!"}, {"t": 2239.93, "speaker": null, "line": "We can't. Julie, no!"}, {"t": 2240.93, "speaker": null, "line": "Julie! Julie!"}, {"t": 2243.55, "speaker": null, "line": "But they found him! We have to help him, please!"}, {"t": 2246.03, "speaker": null, "line": "It's okay."}, {"t": 2248.59, "speaker": null, "line": "I can't..."}, {"t": 2250.38, "speaker": null, "line": "I can't..."}, {"t": 2252.42, "speaker": null, "line": "It's okay."}, {"t": 2256.04, "speaker": null, "line": "It's okay."}, {"t": 2258.69, "speaker": null, "line": "I can't... I can't..."}, {"t": 2262.96, "speaker": null, "line": "It'll be all right."}, {"t": 2265.44, "speaker": null, "line": "It'll be all right."}, {"t": 2272.09, "speaker": null, "line": "Please."}, {"t": 2309.87, "speaker": null, "line": "I don't trust him."}, {"t": 2315.4, "speaker": null, "line": "Look, we're still alive."}, {"t": 2321.1, "speaker": null, "line": "For now."}, {"t": 2327.06, "speaker": null, "line": "Tabitha."}, {"t": 2330.5, "speaker": null, "line": "How you holding up?"}, {"t": 2334.2, "speaker": null, "line": "I'm fine."}, {"t": 2339.9, "speaker": null, "line": "You know,"}, {"t": 2342.08, "speaker": null, "line": "I've probably passed this truck about a dozen times,"}, {"t": 2344.56, "speaker": null, "line": "and I didn't reali... Did you do all this?"}, {"t": 2348.78, "speaker": null, "line": "I thought you were on a journey."}, {"t": 2353.74, "speaker": null, "line": "I was."}, {"t": 2356.66, "speaker": null, "line": "Did you find what you were looking for?"}, {"t": 2362.1, "speaker": null, "line": "What are you drawing?"}, {"t": 2369.84, "speaker": null, "line": "Things I've seen."}, {"t": 2372.93, "speaker": null, "line": "It's good to draw them when you see them..."}, {"t": 2376.16, "speaker": null, "line": "so even if you forget, the pictures remember."}, {"t": 2384.69, "speaker": null, "line": "I thought they were dreams,"}, {"t": 2387.21, "speaker": null, "line": "all those things..."}, {"t": 2390.52, "speaker": null, "line": "but the pictures remembered."}, {"t": 2418.15, "speaker": null, "line": "Oh, the sun's coming up."}, {"t": 2439.74, "speaker": null, "line": "♪ And who by fire"}, {"t": 2443.31, "speaker": null, "line": "♪ Who by water?"}, {"t": 2446.62, "speaker": null, "line": "♪ Who in the sunshine?"}, {"t": 2449.84, "speaker": null, "line": "♪ Who in the night time?"}, {"t": 2452.71, "speaker": null, "line": "♪ Who by high ordeal"}, {"t": 2456.24, "speaker": null, "line": "♪ Who by common trial?"}, {"t": 2459.24, "speaker": null, "line": "♪ Who in your merry-merry month of May?"}, {"t": 2462.68, "speaker": null, "line"