o."}, {"t": 2539.01, "speaker": null, "line": "Hurry!"}, {"t": 2539.01, "speaker": null, "line": "We'll get you outta there."}, {"t": 2540.84, "speaker": null, "line": "Careful! Careful, easy! Easy!"}, {"t": 2543.15, "speaker": null, "line": "Move this out of the way! This is blocking..."}, {"t": 2545.85, "speaker": null, "line": "Come on, get over here!"}, {"t": 2547.85, "speaker": null, "line": "Lend a hand! We're gonna get you outta there!"}, {"t": 2568.96, "speaker": null, "line": "Oh..."}, {"t": 2614.0, "speaker": null, "line": "Okay."}, {"t": 2615.18, "speaker": null, "line": "Yeah."}, {"t": 2617.01, "speaker": null, "line": "Hey, kid."}, {"t": 2618.05, "speaker": null, "line": "How many people did you say?"}, {"t": 2619.7, "speaker": null, "line": "I don't know."}, {"t": 2620.44, "speaker": null, "line": "Maybe 20, 25."}, {"t": 2625.41, "speaker": null, "line": "The lady with the shotgun,"}, {"t": 2627.93, "speaker": null, "line": "she was trying to get people to stay in the diner,"}, {"t": 2629.41, "speaker": null, "line": "but once the house collapsed..."}, {"t": 2630.58, "speaker": null, "line": "No, no, no. What do you mean?"}, {"t": 2632.24, "speaker": null, "line": "What do you mean it collapsed? Which house collapsed?"}, {"t": 2634.02, "speaker": null, "line": "The, uh, the one next to the diner."}, {"t": 2636.37, "speaker": null, "line": "Oh my God!"}, {"t": 2638.33, "speaker": null, "line": "Oh my God, wh-which... town... Which way to town!?"}, {"t": 2640.77, "speaker": null, "line": "Tabitha, it's that way! Tabitha, you..."}, {"t": 2667.4, "speaker": null, "line": "Close it. Let's go."}, {"t": 2671.89, "speaker": null, "line": "Victor, close it!"}, {"t": 2673.97, "speaker": null, "line": "Come on."}, {"t": 2682.07, "speaker": null, "line": "Tabitha?"}]}